@Mini_Shop_HostAddress = http://localhost:5059

### 1. Create a User (POST)
POST {{Mini_Shop_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "John",
  "email": "john@example.com"
}

###

### 2. Get User By ID (GET)
GET {{Mini_Shop_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Create a Product (POST)
POST {{Mini_Shop_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "price": 1200.00,
  "stock": 10
}

###

### 4. Get All Products (GET)
GET {{Mini_Shop_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Get Product By ID (GET)
GET {{Mini_Shop_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Create an Order (POST)
POST {{Mini_Shop_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### 7. Get Orders By User ID (GET)
GET {{Mini_Shop_HostAddress}}/api/users/1/orders
Accept: application/json